      en: ["The total length of the railway corridor is approximately 912 kilometers.", "The Port of Nacala features a natural water depth of up to 14 meters.", "The coal terminal at Nacala-a-Velha was officially inaugurated in May 2017.", "Over 4.4 billion USD was invested in the modernization of the entire corridor.", "The railway line traverses 201 kilometers of territory within Malawi.", "The corridor's transport capacity is roughly 18 million tons of coal per year."],
