      en: ["Cimentos de Moçambique was established as early as 1920.", "The primary factory is located in the Matola industrial zone near Maputo.", "The company is a member of the international Cimpor group.", "The annual production capacity is over 600,000 tons of cement.", "The plant supplied materials for major projects like the Katembe Bridge.", "Modern filtration systems have been installed to minimize dust emissions."],
