      en: ["The dam is situated on the Incomati River in the Moamba District.", "The planned reservoir storage capacity is 760 million cubic meters.", "A 15 MW hydroelectric power station is integrated into the design.", "Construction activities officially started in the year 2014.", "Initial funding was provided by the Brazilian development bank BNDES.", "Once completed, it will provide irrigation for 19,000 hectares of land."],
